  "description": "OpenAPI 3.x adapter for Bowire's REST protocol plugin. Implements IBowireOpenApiAdapter against Microsoft.OpenApi 3.x — the modern library line. Embedded ASP.NET hosts that mix Bowire's REST plugin with ASP.NET Core 10's built-in AddOpenApi() (which still pins Microsoft.OpenApi 2.x) should reference the sibling Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Protocol.Rest.OpenApi2 package instead to avoid a single-DLL collision. Standalone bowire CLI bundles this adapter so the laptop happy-path keeps working out of the box.",
